{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience mazes like never before! Maze Engine delivers an unparalleled variety of procedurally generated labyrinthine experiences. Switch between intense first-person chases, strategic top-down navigation, immersive third-person adventures, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a constant stream of community-made content from the Steam Workshop, <strong>free for everyone to download and play!</strong> Ready to become a maze master yourself? Unleash your inner architect with the Level Editor DLC (sold separately) and share your creations with the world.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2537620?t=1756090378","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2537620?t=1756090378","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537620/51e583815009903f0cfbe2375e3a9a156164b6c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756090378","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2537620/51e583815009903f0cfbe2375e3a9a156164b6c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756090378","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience mazes like never before! Maze Engine delivers an unparalleled variety of procedurally generated labyrinthine experiences. Switch between intense first-person chases, strategic top-down navigation, immersive third-person adventures, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy a constant stream of community-made content from the Steam